          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi esondela, ewubona umuzi, wawukhalela, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "esithi: Kungathi ngabe wazile lawe ngalolusuku izinto eziletha ukuthula; kodwake zifihlakele emehlweni akho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngoba uzakwehlelwa zinsuku, lapho izitha zakho zizakwakhela umthangala, zikuzingelezele, zikuvimbele inxa zonke, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "zikusakaze phansi, wena labantwana abaphakathi kwakho, zingatshiyi ilitshe lelilodwa phezu kwelinye phakathi kwakho, ngoba ungasazanga isikhathi sokuhanjelwa kwakho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.44"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
