              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wayefundisa ethempelini insuku zonke, kodwa abapristi abakhulu, lababhali, lezikhulu zesizwe, bathanda ukumbulala.",
          "type": "text",
